			"notes": "### Fixed\n- Crash on load with NeoForge and Forge: the `mod_compat_replace` structure processor was registered directly into the already-frozen vanilla registry during mod construction, which those loaders reject. It is now registered through the mod loading registration event. (Fabric was unaffected.)\n- Villagers now spawn in the large cart and barn structures — their villager jigsaws pointed at a structure pool that does not exist, so no villagers were placed."
		},
